19257::$$$message_0147_0000_0000$$$::"Um... This is a pain, so I'll let you choose."[lr]::
19258::$$$message_0147_0000_0001$$$::"Oh, really? Good boy. Way to show respect for your betters. Your big sis is happy to see it![lr]::
19259::$$$message_0147_0000_0002$$$::Buuut..."::
19260::$$$message_0147_0001_0000$$$::"Never let the enemy handle the quiz!"[rf]::
19261::$$$message_0147_0002_0000$$$::"You noob! Do you think that's enough to outsmart the Quiz Fiend!?[lr]::
19262::$$$message_0147_0002_0001$$$::I'm going to put you through the hardest quiz now, you wimp!"::
19263::$$$message_0147_0003_0000$$$::"Heh heh. Answer them all right, and you'll get one of my wonderful wallpapers!"::

